  "description": "The Geek Vape Sonder Q2 Pod Kit is the ideal compact vape kit for vapers who want a balance of simplicity, performance, and more than a dash of style. Powered by a built-in 1350mAh battery, the Sonder Q2 delivers up to 30W of adjustable power for a satisfying and smooth vaping experience. Designed for both MTL (Mouth-to-Lung) and RDL (Restricted Direct-to-Lung) vaping, the Sonder Q 2 is compatible with Geek Vape’s Q Cartridge series , featuring a 2ml e-liquid capacity that meets TPD compliance. Its adjustable airflow allows you to customise your draw, ensuring you get the perfect vape every time. The Sonder Q2 is lightweight and comfortable to carry, with a durable aluminium alloy casing. Plus, its sleek RGB light ring adds a modern touch while indicating the device’s status. Charging the Sonder Q2 is fast and easy, thanks to the USB Type-C port and 1A charging speed, ensuring your device is ready to go in no time. For added convenience, the device features an inhale activation system, making it incredibly easy to use—just take a puff to activate the device. Whether you’re new to vaping or a seasoned vaper, the Geek Vape Sonder Q 2 Pod Kit delivers long-lasting battery life, vibrant flavour, and a hassle-free vaping experience. Browse our extensive selection of vape liquid and find a delicious companion for your kit. Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
